      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-54412",
      ":question/problem": "Anna and Mary are training for a marathon. From the same starting point, both take different straight-line paths. After an hour, Ana is $6km$ from the starting point, while Mary is $8km$ from the starting point. If the distance between Anna and Mary is $12km$, determine the measure of the angle formed between Anna's location, the starting point, and Mary's location. Round your answer to one decimal place.\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question."
